            make(78, "An-Naba", 38, "يَوْمَ يَقُومُ الرُّوحُ وَالْمَلَائِكَةُ صَفًّا ۖ لَّا يَتَكَلَّمُونَ إِلَّا مَنْ أَذِنَ لَهُ الرَّحْمَٰنُ وَقَالَ صَوَابًا", "يَوْمَ يَقُومُ <hamzat_wasl>ال</hamzat_wasl>رُّوحُ وَ<hamzat_wasl>الْ</hamzat_wasl>مَلَ<madd>ائِكَةُ</madd> <tafkhim>صَفًّا</tafkhim> ۖ لَّا يَتَكَلَّمُونَ إِلَّا مَنْ أَذِنَ لَهُ <hamzat_wasl>ال</hamzat_wasl>رَّحْمَٰنُ وَقَالَ <tafkhim>صَوَابًا</tafkhim>", "Yawma yaqumur-ruhu wal-mala'ikatu saffal la yatakallamuna illa man adhina lahur-rahmanu wa qala sawaba", "The Day that the Spirit and the angels will stand in rows, they will not speak except for one whom the Most Merciful permits, and he will say what is correct.", listOf(TajweedRuleType.HAMZAT_WASL, TajweedRuleType.MADD, TajweedRuleType.TAFKHIM)),
